do (RNES) e a Reserva Natural do Estuário do Tejo (RNET) –, os dois estuários e a serra, abrangendo zonas do PNA e da RNES (respetivamente 15,28 km2 e 17,01 km2).\",\"extras\":{},\"id\":\"68d1257bfcce219b2bea7ce5\",\"last_modified\":\"2026-06-09T12:15:27.279000+00:00\",\"logo\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/s/avatars/ab/e38cbca9a842dab93e4b7e9fd837ad-original.png\",\"logo_thumbnail\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/s/avatars/ab/e38cbca9a842dab93e4b7e9fd837ad-100.png\",\"members\":[{\"label\":\"Administrador\",\"role\":\"admin\",\"since\":\"2025-09-22T10:31:23.479000+00:00\",\"user\":{\"avatar\":null,\"avatar_thumbnail\":null,\"class\":\"User\",\"email\":\"***@cm-palmela.pt\",\"first_name\":\"Cláudia\",\"id\":\"68d1226674cd6016f1ea7ce5\",\"last_login_at\":null,\"last_name\":\"Romba\",\"page\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/users/claudia-romba\",\"slug\":\"claudia-romba\",\"uri\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/api/1/users/claudia-romba/\"}},{\"label\":\"Editor\",\"role\":\"editor\",\"since\":\"2025-11-14T15:38:28.256000+00:00\",\"user\":{\"avatar\":null,\"avatar_thumbnail\":null,\"class\":\"User\",\"email\":\"***@cm-palmela.pt\",\"first_name\":\"Mariana Isabel\",\"id\":\"68f24ec971dc4d91de0592f3\",\"last_login_at\":null,\"last_name\":\"Cegonho Couto\",\"page\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/users/mariana-isabel-cegonho-couto\",\"slug\":\"mariana-isabel-cegonho-couto\",\"uri\":\"https://dados.gov.pt/api/1/users/mariana-isabel-cegonho-couto/\"}}],\"metrics\":{\"dataservice_views\":0,\"dataservices\":0,\"dataservices_by_months\":{\"2025-06\":0,\"2025-07\":0,\"2025-08\":0,\"2025-09\":0,\"2025-10\":0,\"2025-11\":0,\"2025-12\":0,\"2026-01\":0,\"2026-02\":0,\"2026-03\":0,\"2026-04\":0,\"2026-05\":0,\"2026-06\":0},\"datasets\":5,\"datasets_by_months\":{\"2025-06\":0,\"2025-07\":0,\"2025-08\":0,\"2025-09\":0,\"2025-10\":0,\"2025-11\":1,\"2025-12\":2,\"2026-01\":0,\"2026-02\":0,\"2026-03\":0,\"2026-04\":0,\"2026-05\":1,\"2026-06\":0},\"datasets_followers_by_months\":{\"2025-06\":0,\"2025-07\":0,\"2025-08\":0,\"2025-0